│ (3.5%;"}, {"study_index": 7, "title": "Low-molecular-weight heparin versus placebo for the prevention of venous      │
│ thromboembolism in metastatic breast cancer or stage III/IV lung cancer", "abstract": "In 2 double-blind studies,    │
